description	"Rebel Officer

A customizable multilife Rebel Officer with several gadgets who can specialize in inspiring allies, special grenades, and utility.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee

^6Inventory:
- Sentry Gun ^3[CS2]
- Seeker Droid ^3[CS3]
- Medpack ^3[CS4]

^8Attributes:
- Dexterity (1)
- Rally
- Empathic Leadership (Ally Stat Viewer)
- Voice of the Rebellion (Lights Beacon)
- Inherited Knowledge (+30% Hack Speed)
- Commlink Device (Tracking Beacon)

^3Abilities:
- Dodge (2) ^3[CS1]"
